    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241660/extras/74487b42841311089f7de2243c6aa2dc.poster.avif?t=1732219084\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241660/extras/74487b42841311089f7de2243c6aa2dc.webm?t=1732219084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241660/extras/74487b42841311089f7de2243c6aa2dc.mp4?t=1732219084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>SESSIONS blends horror, action, and atmospheric exploration. The player takes on the role of a synthetic human in a dystopian world overrun by mysterious creatures. In this dark sci-fi story, you must face existential horrors and frightening creatures. It's a lonely and evocative game about exploring the unknown and discovering the horrors of the human condition.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241660/extras/f1603f8bac20b8ebb6278e94ad09cc3a.poster.avif?t=1732219084\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241660/extras/f1603f8bac20b8ebb6278e94ad09cc3a.webm?t=1732219084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241660/extras/f1603f8bac20b8ebb6278e94ad09cc3a.mp4?t=1732219084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A dark and mysterious narrative.<br><br></li><li>A gloomy, vast, surreal, and interconnected world to be explored.<br><br></li><li>Your journey will introduce you to fascinating characters, each with their own motivations.<br><br></li><li> Immersive non-linear exploration.<br><br></li><li> Slow-paced, methodical gameplay with horror elements.<br><br></li><li>Customize your weapons with the mod system to better fit your playstyle.<br><br><strong>SESSIONS is the sequel to REDO! However, knowledge of the first game is not necessary.</strong></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241660/extras/74487b42841311089f7de2243c6aa2dc.poster.avif?t=1732219084\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241660/extras/74487b42841311089f7de2243c6aa2dc.webm?t=1732219084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241660/extras/74487b42841311089f7de2243c6aa2dc.mp4?t=1732219084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>SESSIONS blends horror, action, and atmospheric exploration. The player takes on the role of a synthetic human in a dystopian world overrun by mysterious creatures. In this dark sci-fi story, you must face existential horrors and frightening creatures. It's a lonely and evocative game about exploring the unknown and discovering the horrors of the human condition.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241660/extras/f1603f8bac20b8ebb6278e94ad09cc3a.poster.avif?t=1732219084\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241660/extras/f1603f8bac20b8ebb6278e94ad09cc3a.webm?t=1732219084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241660/extras/f1603f8bac20b8ebb6278e94ad09cc3a.mp4?t=1732219084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A dark and mysterious narrative.<br><br></li><li>A gloomy, vast, surreal, and interconnected world to be explored.<br><br></li><li>Your journey will introduce you to fascinating characters, each with their own motivations.<br><br></li><li> Immersive non-linear exploration.<br><br></li><li> Slow-paced, methodical gameplay with horror elements.<br><br></li><li>Customize your weapons with the mod system to better fit your playstyle.<br><br><strong>SESSIONS is the sequel to REDO! However, knowledge of the first game is not necessary.</strong></li></ul>",
